# Everything a RUN produces. The rig writes frame dumps, disassembly listings
# and logs next to its own scripts, which was fine in a temp directory and is
# not fine now that this one is version controlled. 30 MB of screenshots and
# half a megabyte of objdump output are all reproducible from the card image and
# the scripts here, so none of it belongs in git.
*.png
*.dis
*.log
*.raw
shots/
